        <h1 class="post-detail__title">Creating a Solid Foundation</h1>

        <div class="post-detail__featured-image">
          <img src="/assets/images/news/50207.webp" alt="Creating a Solid Foundation" loading="lazy">
        </div>

        <div class="post-detail__content">
          <p>The Community Foundation works year-round to support local nonprofits from the bottom up. From maintaining an annual, dependable fundraiser for participating nonprofits to continuing education, the Community Foundation of Teton Valley is consistently building a stronger foundation for organizations to root into. Through these efforts, the Community Foundation creates stability while encouraging collaboration and connection.</p>

<p>Consider making a&nbsp;<strong>designated gift&nbsp;</strong>to the&nbsp;<a href="https://cftetonvalley.org/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Community Foundation of Teton Valley</a>&nbsp;during the&nbsp;<strong>14th Annual Tin Cup Challenge&nbsp;</strong>to help maintain a solid foundation for Teton Valley&#8217;s nonprofit community to continue to build upon.</p>

<h4>___________________________________________</h4>

<p><strong>Workshops —</strong><br>Our spring and fall&nbsp;<a href="https://cftetonvalley.org/events/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">workshops</a>&nbsp;give nonprofit leaders an opportunity to network, continue their education, and practice nonprofit best practices within their own organizations. Many of our workshops build on each other to offer continued growth and tactical strategies to put knowledge into action.</p>

<h4>___________________________________________</h4>

<p><strong><strong>Nonprofit Community Space —</strong></strong><br>Through generous year-end donations, this community space went live in February 2020, right before the pandemic struck. The Foundation has been delighted to re-open this room with upgraded technology that can host in-person board meetings, with a Zoom component. Nonprofits are quickly seeing the benefits and&nbsp;<a href="https://cftetonvalley.org/product/conference-room/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">reservations</a>are booking rapidly.</p>

<h4>___________________________________________</h4>

<p><strong><strong><strong>Nonprofit Library —&nbsp;</strong><br></strong></strong>Our newly established nonprofit library concentrates on fundraising, board &amp; nonprofit management, program evaluation, marketing, strategic planning, finance, and leadership. We appreciate having this resource available for nonprofit leaders to reinforce their skill sets and encourage best practices.</p>

<h4>___________________________________________</h4>

<p><strong><strong><strong><strong>New Board Member Brief —&nbsp;</strong><br></strong></strong></strong>Our New Board Member Briefs have seen tremendous popularity.&nbsp;This half-hour presentation orients new board members on the basic principles on what it means to serve on a nonprofit board.&nbsp;&nbsp;The presentation simultaneously creates a peer network to help foster support and improves nonprofits from the inside out.&nbsp;<a href="https://cftetonvalley.org/event/11302/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Sign up</a>&nbsp;for the October 5th offering!</p>

<h4>___________________________________________</h4>

<p><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong>Talks with Tim —&nbsp;</strong><br></strong></strong></strong></strong>These monthly meetings feature an opportunity for executive directors to connect, question, share, collaborate, support, and celebrate with each other. With this networking opportunity, peers can discuss relevant topics of the day in today&#8217;s fast-changing environment.</p>

<h4>___________________________________________</h4>

<p><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong>Expertise —&nbsp;</strong><br></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong>Our team is always ready to share knowledge, experiences, or simply lend an ear to local nonprofit leaders in order to support their mission and goals. As one board member recently put it,&nbsp;<em>&#8220;Everyone is so helpful and knowledgable, and just always goes the extra mile&nbsp;to help get things done.&#8221;&nbsp;</em>Additionally<em>,&nbsp;</em>Tim provides regular outreach and counseling to nonprofits to ensure stability within the nonprofit community.</p>

<h4>___________________________________________</h4>

<p><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong>Volunteer Dashboard —&nbsp;</strong><br></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong>Our&nbsp;<a href="https://cftetonvalley.org/volunteer-opportunities/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Volunteer Dashboard</a>&nbsp;allows local organizations to post immediate and on-going needs. This allows volunteers to readily identify community needs that align with their passions and availability. Our&nbsp;<a href="https://cftetonvalley.org/nonprofit-directory-2/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Nonprofit Directory</a>&nbsp;also provides ready access to reach nonprofits directly or connect to their social media accounts.</p>

<h4>___________________________________________</h4>

<p><strong>Community Gazebo —</strong>&nbsp;<br>In recognition of local nonprofit leaders ingenuity, perseverance, and collaboration during the pandemic, Foundation board and staff refurbished this community space for the benefit of all. The gazebo, located next door to the Community Foundation is meant to be an enduring honor to how local nonprofits came together in the face of adversity. Stop by and enjoy it!</p>

<h4>___________________________________________</h4>

<p><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong>Equipment Rental —&nbsp;</strong><br></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong>While&nbsp;<a href="https://cftetonvalley.org/shop/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">equipment rental</a>&nbsp;saw little action during the pandemic, the program has readily picked up steam this summer &#8211; tables, chairs, coolers, and tents are going out on a regular basis &#8211; alleviating event costs for innumerable nonprofit events.</p>

<h4>___________________________________________</h4>

<p>Consider re-enforcing the foundation of our local nonprofit community with a&nbsp;<strong>designated gift</strong>&nbsp;to the&nbsp;<strong>Community Foundation of Teton Valley</strong>&nbsp;during this year&#8217;s Tin Cup Challenge. Gifts must be received by&nbsp;<strong>Friday, July 23rd at 5PM:</strong></p>

